#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Guardian Lite privileged, fixed-verb Plesk helper.

No arbitrary command, path, rule or shell execution is accepted from HTTP.
The Plesk controller is the admin authorization boundary; this binary additionally
validates all inputs and filesystem operations. Linux / Python >= 3.8.
"""
